Package: stochprofIC
Title: A pipeline for generalized additive modelling of transcriptional heterogeneity for 10-cell RNA sequencing data
Version: 0.3.5
Authors@R: 
    person("Mercè", "Garí", , "mercegari@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6903-0732"))
Description: A pipeline to detect and parameterize transcriptional heterogeneity of 10-cell data by normalizing for a set of covariates and adjusting for technical variation to obtain corrected data.
